   "text": "The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.\n\nYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $N. The time has come to send you into the field.\n\nAre you prepared to undertake your next mission?\r\n",
